    "b0003-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "296df076422f4e351e6bd9271757061d06a64d0088dc5db6e5e20d1d75e115b8",
      "targetHash": "16eb00daf4d913613be41339e51d5805d4ab4ae911b91989d3fa02cbf7e2d44a",
      "machineHash": "16eb00daf4d913613be41339e51d5805d4ab4ae911b91989d3fa02cbf7e2d44a",
      "machineText": "很明显，人们对于为 Go 项目添加 Web 前端感到兴奋，并且几乎立刻就将这个项目推进到了我所创建的概念验证之外。当时，Wails 使用 [webview](https://github.com/webview/webview) 项目处理前端，而 Windows 上唯一的选择是 IE11 渲染器。许多错误报告都源于这一限制：JavaScript/CSS 支持不佳，也没有可用于调试的开发者工具。这种开发体验令人沮丧，但当时几乎没有什么办法可以解决。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "It was clear that people were excited about adding web frontends to their Go\\ projects, and almost i…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
