    "b0004-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e1f069c7768ef44649e56089e0d51bf038aae82ba30675c379ab758e441807d3",
      "targetHash": "4a498486f0f6b32fd2d906645d3a9d9a2dcb68a067b4cda17e10a9bb35697eb8",
      "machineHash": "4a498486f0f6b32fd2d906645d3a9d9a2dcb68a067b4cda17e10a9bb35697eb8",
      "machineText": "很长一段时间以来，我一直坚信 Microsoft 最终不得不解决其浏览器问题。世界在不断前进，前端开发蓬勃发展，而 IE 已经无法满足需要。当 Microsoft 宣布转而采用 Chromium 作为其新浏览器发展方向的基础时，我知道 Wails 用上它只是时间问题，届时 Windows 上的开发体验也将提升到一个新水平。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "For a long time, I'd firmly believed that Microsoft would eventually have to\\ sort out their browser…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
