      "machineHash": "8eaf5c0d9f19008f675d51a5b67f840b2cc45e1ffb59e92a1a525081a38af5cd",
      "machineText": "今天，我很高兴地宣布：*Wails v2 Windows 测试版*！此版本包含大量值得详细介绍的内容，所以拿杯饮料坐下来，我们开始吧……",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Today, I am pleased to announce: *Wails v2 Beta for Windows*! There's a huge\\ amount to unpack in th…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
