      "machineHash": "c82032d9285899f064760e4ceb6b93f96af32c836746742e647d8643d460e623",
      "machineText": "Windows 开发者终于能为自己的应用程序使用一流的渲染引擎了！为了让前端代码能在 Windows 上运行而费尽周折的日子已经一去不复返。此外，你还能获得一流的开发者工具体验！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Finally, Windows developers get a first class rendering engine for their\\ applications! Gone are the…",
      "provider": "codex",
