      "targetHash": "e713d8755ccefadb5bf99014961b70d717ab168bfdcde580d9e4da09e0ae8869",
      "machineHash": "e713d8755ccefadb5bf99014961b70d717ab168bfdcde580d9e4da09e0ae8869",
      "machineText": "不过，WebView2 组件确实要求将 `WebView2Loader.dll` 放在二进制文件旁边。这让分发过程比我们 Go 开发者所习惯的稍微麻烦一些。据我所知，所有使用 WebView2 的解决方案和库都有这项依赖。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The WebView2 component does, however, have a requirement to have the\\ `WebView2Loader.dll` sitting a…",
