      "machineHash": "3b344cfdcdf8efe68eeab22bbfc1406676a33191539c0515b3e664f3c0f49cdd",
      "machineText": "不过，我非常兴奋地宣布，Wails 应用程序_没有这项要求_！多亏了 [John Chadwick](https://github.com/jchv) 的高超技艺，我们可以将这个 dll 打包进二进制文件，并让 Windows 像它实际存在于磁盘上一样加载它。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "However, I'm really excited to announce that Wails applications _have no such\\ requirement_! Thanks …",
