    "b0032-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f197c0f9e5f5cf10e17ca7feff17b0cd8f0e4c598847e9fc5e008e7e913bd1c2",
      "targetHash": "d61f35d2117462b97ae9994de85769d4a14a7da24e5fac6c98987b584b83bb49",
      "machineHash": "d61f35d2117462b97ae9994de85769d4a14a7da24e5fac6c98987b584b83bb49",
      "machineText": "此外，还会在端口34115上启动一个 Web 服务器。它会向任何连接到该端口的浏览器提供你的应用程序。所有已连接的 Web 浏览器都会响应系统事件，例如资源更改时触发的热重载。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, a webserver will start on port 34115. This will serve your\\ application to any …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0033-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d011d90fb9ff0557dec77e87205e0636f2d1cf1b5ab76a9238bd390f6dad3631",
      "targetHash": "8e034d2cdabea95d2289bd6d06403af44c9b3852cb76e492ecd78135e4e087e3",
      "machineHash": "8e034d2cdabea95d2289bd6d06403af44c9b3852cb76e492ecd78135e4e087e3",
      "machineText": "使用 Go 开发应用程序时，我们习惯于处理结构体。将结构体发送到前端并用作应用程序状态通常很有帮助。在 v1 中，这一过程需要大量手动操作，给开发者带来了一定负担。我很高兴地宣布，在 v2 中，以开发模式运行的任何应用程序都会为所有用作已绑定方法输入或输出参数的结构体自动生成 TypeScript 模型，从而让两个环境之间的数据模型交换无缝衔接。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Go, we are used to dealing with structs in our applications. It's often\\ useful to send structs t…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0034-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e4a6145b3a813cb9128eeed038c86ca46725187be24a9bb2ca09de244178097b",
      "targetHash": "f7f258b21de21c7cb09bba6f201f504ecdbd0d2c7715a01e4417703e74889446",
      "machineHash": "f7f258b21de21c7cb09bba6f201f504ecdbd0d2c7715a01e4417703e74889446",
      "machineText": "此外，系统还会动态生成另一个 JS 模块，用于封装所有已绑定的方法。该模块会为你的方法提供 JSDoc，从而在 IDE 中提供代码补全和提示。在这个自动生成、用于封装 Go 代码的模块中按 Tab 键时，数据模型会自动导入，这种体验真的很棒！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, another JS module is dynamically generated wrapping all\\ your bound methods. Th…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
