    "b0037-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "721e813afcbd80a8d17de197ccf2f10bff249a89c4365ad5c2e3a492b2efb8ea",
      "targetHash": "5d585b54983cfce735cc54addc9d1a14c1f2ae2726e60b733f25ce17e7d771ab",
      "machineHash": "5d585b54983cfce735cc54addc9d1a14c1f2ae2726e60b733f25ce17e7d771ab",
      "machineText": "让应用快速启动并运行一直是 Wails 项目的核心目标。项目发布之初，我们曾尝试覆盖当时众多的现代框架：React、Vue 和 Angular。前端开发领域观点纷呈、发展迅速，很难始终紧跟变化！因此，我们发现基础模板很快就会过时，带来了令人头疼的维护工作。这也意味着我们无法为最新、最出色的技术栈提供时髦的现代模板。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Getting an application up and running quickly was always a key goal for the\\ Wails project. When we …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0038-text-01": {
