      "targetHash": "8044c52c2e54676d9c6ddc543c017e98c721875e00735db7d81273fa8a04fa18",
      "machineHash": "8044c52c2e54676d9c6ddc543c017e98c721875e00735db7d81273fa8a04fa18",
      "machineText": "在 v2 中，我希望赋能社区，让大家能够自行创建和托管模板，而不必依赖 Wails 项目。因此，你现在可以使用由社区支持的模板创建项目！我希望这能激励开发者打造一个充满活力的项目模板生态系统。我非常期待看到开发者社区能创造出怎样的成果！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "With v2, I wanted to empower the community by giving you the ability to create\\ and host templates y…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
