    "b0040-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "32a038d0a0b10321cc0c0a1c340fc8b5cb9cb26a04a3437fdef524acf1cdc913",
      "targetHash": "859af9c990f93171a79d8f6ac6b24d7525ca3086b0d1a849e5516a6aef746239",
      "machineHash": "859af9c990f93171a79d8f6ac6b24d7525ca3086b0d1a849e5516a6aef746239",
      "machineText": "Wails v2 为项目奠定了新的基础。此版本旨在收集大家对新方案的反馈，并在正式发布前修复所有错误。非常欢迎你提出意见。请将任何反馈提交到[v2 Beta](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions/828)讨论区。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Wails v2 represents a new foundation for the project. The aim of this release is\\ to get feedback on…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0041-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "08d77cbe2585b15e606a108db06dc0e08a0f664e0198b21fb3203f5f5e99a870",
      "targetHash": "5303ef5bc6a7d14cd0c38d6e24868cff8b5d0be371bad1b52522b4168222c84d",
      "machineHash": "5303ef5bc6a7d14cd0c38d6e24868cff8b5d0be371bad1b52522b4168222c84d",
      "machineText": "走到这一步，过程经历了许多波折、方向调整，甚至推倒重来。一部分原因是早期的一些技术决策需要更改；另一部分原因是，我们曾花时间构建变通方案来应对的某些核心问题，后来在上游得到了解决，Go 的 embed 功能就是一个很好的例子。幸运的是，一切都在恰当的时机水到渠成，如今我们已经拥有了现阶段所能实现的最佳解决方案。我相信这段等待是值得的——即使在2个月前，这一切也不可能实现。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There were many twists and turns, pivots and u-turns to get to this point. This\\ was due partly to e…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
