      "targetHash": "c21522de1f926d2ca89796fd5faa5cd953376593511fa78211b171e2701bf02d",
      "machineHash": "c21522de1f926d2ca89796fd5faa5cd953376593511fa78211b171e2701bf02d",
      "machineText": "我还要向以下各位致以衷心的感谢 :pray:，因为没有他们，这个版本根本不会问世：",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I also need to give a huge thank you :pray: to the following people because\\ without them, this rele…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
