      "machineHash": "5b4893bfe48f12466073993975550fa2dd37209eee814339ab8896d9373590ca",
      "machineText": "[Misite Bao](https://github.com/misitebao)——不辞辛劳地完成了大量中文翻译工作，同时也是一位极其出色的错误发现者。",
      "status": "final",
